8. SECURITY OBSERVATIONS

Wireshark can help identify unusual network communication patterns.

Examples include:

Unencrypted HTTP communication.
Unexpected DNS queries.
Repeated TCP connection attempts.
Unusual ARP responses.
Unexpected traffic to unfamiliar destinations.
Repeated TCP retransmissions.

These observations are indicators for further investigation, not proof of malicious activity.

